    {
      "file": "kernel/riscv.h",
      "description": "1. ​指令分解​\n​**csrw satp, %0**​\ncsrw 是 RISC-V 的 ​CSR 写指令​（Control and Status Register Write），功能是将通用寄存器的值写入指定的 CSR 寄存器\n。\nsatp 是目标 CSR 寄存器，负责控制虚拟内存地址转换​（如页表基地址、地址空间标识符 ASID、内存模式等）\n。\n%0 是占位符，表示内联汇编的第一个输入操作数（即变量 x）。\n​**输入约束 : \"r\" (x)**​\n\"r\" 要求编译器将变量 x 的值分配到一个通用寄存器中（如 t0、a0 等）\n。\n执行时，该寄存器的值会被写入 satp。\n​**volatile 关键字**​\n禁止编译器优化或重排这段汇编，确保指令按原顺序执行​（对硬件寄存器操作至关重要）\n。",
      "line": 207
    },
    {
      "file": "kernel/riscv.h",
      "description": "when xv6 changes a page table, it must tell the CPU to invalidate corresponding cached TLB entries.\nXv6 executes sfence.vma in kvminithart after reloading the satp register, and in the trampoline code that switches to a\nuser page table before returning to user space.\n",
      "line": 333
    },
    {
      "file": "kernel/kalloc.c",
      "description": "kinit calls freerange to add memory to the free list via per-page calls to kfree. A PTE can only refer to a physical address that is aligned on a 4096-byte boundary (is a multiple of 4096), so freerange uses PGROUNDUP to ensure that it frees only aligned physical addresses. The allocator starts with no memory; these calls to kfree give it some to manage.",
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "file": "kernel/exec.c",
      "description": "The first step is a quick check that the file probably contains an ELF binary. An ELF binary starts with the four-byte “magic number” 0x7F, ‘E’, ‘L’, ‘F’, or ELF_MAGIC (kernel/elf.h:3). If the ELF header has the right magic number, exec assumes that the binary is well-formed.",
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "file": "kernel/exec.c",
      "description": "allocates a new page table with no user mappings with proc_pagetable",
      "line": 38
    },
    {
      "file": "kernel/exec.c",
